  "description": "<p><\/p><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;'><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px; clear:both; overflow:visible;'><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>ESG debt instruments, including g<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>reen <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>bonds<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>, <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>social bonds<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>, <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>sustainability bonds<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>, and <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>sustainability<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>-<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>linked bonds,<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>are fixed-income securities designed to <\/span><\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'>sustain or improve the condition of the environment or society or governance practices<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'>.<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/div><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px; clear:both; overflow:visible;'><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:10.5333px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>Green Bonds are fixed income instruments where the proceeds will be exclusively directed to finance or re-finance, in part or in full, <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>new<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> and/or existing green projects. <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>Social bonds have use of proceeds that are dedicated to projects with positive social outcomes.<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>Sustainability bonds have a mix of green and social use of proceeds. <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>S<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>ustainability linked bond<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>s<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> (SLB) <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>are<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> financial<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> instrument<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>s<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> where financial and structural characteristics are <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>linked to <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>achieving performance <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>objectives<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> that improve the condition of the environment or society. <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>SLB<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>s <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>are not use-of <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>proceed<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> bonds. They <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>typically include <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>key performance indicators which are structurally connected to <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>the issuer\u2019s goal achievement. <\/span><\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/div><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px; clear:both; overflow:visible;'><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:10.5333px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight:bold; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'>Sources:\u202f<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>LSEG<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>. Accessed on <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>202<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>5<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>-0<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>2<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>-<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>24<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>;<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> IMF staff calculations.<\/span><\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/div><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px; clear:both; overflow:visible;'><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:10.5333px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px;