-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>ESG <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>Bond Issuances by Country<\/span><\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'><ul><li><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>Cumulative <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>ESG<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> Bond Issuances by Type of Currency<\/span><\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'><ul><li><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'>Cumulative Green Bond Issuances by Use of Proceeds<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'><ul><li><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'>Cumulative Social Bond Issuances by Use of Proceeds<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'><ul><li><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'>Cumulative Sustainability Bond Issuances by Use of Proceeds<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'><ul><li><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'>Sovereign Green Bond Issuances <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px; clear:both; overflow:visible;'><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight:bold; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'>Metadata:\u202f<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/div><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px; clear:both; overflow:visible;'><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>The source dataset is based on <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>LSEG (formerly Refinitiv)<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>, which <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>contain<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> bond-by-bond issuances for<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> Green Bonds, Social Bonds, Sustainability Bonds, and Sustainability-Linked Bonds<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> starting from <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>2006<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>to 202<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>4<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>. <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>Bond<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>s<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>by type <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>encompass <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>investment grade, high-yield, and not-rated <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>bonds, <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>commercial papers, certificate<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>s<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> of deposit, and sukuk<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>s.<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> By issuer type, bonds encompass government, corporate, agency, non-US <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; background-position:0px 100%; background-repeat:repeat-x; background-image:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQiPjxnIGZpbGw9Im5vbmUiIGZpbGwtcnVsZT0iZXZlbm9kZCI+PHBhdGggc3Ryb2tlPSIjRUIwMDAwIiBkPSJNMCAzYzEuMjUgMCAxLjI1LTIgMi41LTJTMy43NSAzIDUgMyIvPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0wIDBoNXY0SDB6Ii8+PC9nPjwvc3ZnPg==&quot;); border-bottom:1px solid transparent;'>munis<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>, and other gov/supra bonds.<\/span><\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/div><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px; clear:both; overflow:visible;'><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:10.5333px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight:bold; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'>Methodology:\u202f<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/div><\/div><div style='margin:0px; padding:0px; clear:both; overflow:visible; font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;'><p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:10.5333px; padding:0px; font-kerning:none;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>The data are aggregated by country of incorporations, use of proceeds, type of currency and type of issuers (nonfinancial corporations, other financial corporations, banks, state <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>owned entities, sovereign, state and local governments and international organizations). Sovereign green bonds are green bonds issued by central government<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>s<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> and central <\/span><\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures:none !important;'><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>bank<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>s<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>.<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>Compilation of the indicator is based on the <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>methodology<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> used by London Stock Exchange Group, and divergences may be <\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'>observed<\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px;'> when compared to data from other providers.<\/span><\/span><span style='margin:0px; padding:0px; line-height:19px; font-family:Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;'> <\/span><\/font><\/p><\/div>",
